+# ---------------------------------------------------------------- WQ-583 code half (Will 2026-10-31 20:26 ET,
+# verbatim "can you do this part now"; DOCKET L912; acceptance tests/ACCEPTANCE_wq583_candidate_moves_reuse_2026-10-31.md;
